Hunt for open redirects. Sources: user-controlled URLs/paths in query/body/headers (next, returnUrl, redirect, callback). Sinks: HTTP redirect responses (redirect(), Location header, res.redirect, 30x). Report any redirect whose destination is taken from user input without an allowlist of permitted hosts/paths — protocol-relative (//evil.com) and absolute external URLs both qualify.
